# W7e, host a (k10): with b on stag0101's matz02 (both parked at the barrier) its link is cut for 20 s (the client's
# DW4_ONLINE_TEST_CUT_AT_PARK at its park). a waits at the entrance until b joined: the route starts there. After the join
# a stays (round r2b: a's script ended at 600 sealed ticks and its quit ended the instance before b's 900).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
idle until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
route {route:stag0101_west}
mat matz02 yes 2 until stage=stag0102,control or epoch>=@330
log a arrived in stag0102
wander 330 140 15 until present=2,sealed>=600 fail stage=stagml11
log a joined b there, still host
# (The int-i1b test matrix: b.script waits until @300 since 0cca6307, so a stays until @330 too; with frames>=1500
# alone a quit 35 s after its join, at about @255, the instance ended and b, still in its @300 wait, went home.)
wander 330 140 15 until frames>=1500,epoch>=@330
log a stayed for b
